        "sid": "ROM 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eaweega aba jeeda Guroorooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa manda girgweaksiinda aba badahuuka fuga mida jeeda Gristo Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba deaweedeeda Guroorooda eaweega mida jeeda Gristo Yesu nigoonan giibaldeaba geaw, aba heeda deaweedeeda riing'eeda ea miyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ng'asheegiga mwoamu aba deaweedean, aba gideaba manda uurjeenga aba ng'asheega saseedean, iidu aba giijeaknooda ajeagu ASEETA Orjeedaanyi nea ghwanung' gawuurji siida mideawa riing'eeda, amadu aba badayda riing'eeda iidu goorgweaksa riing'eeda mida saseeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda gwasa ginyaashta deaweeda aba jeesingaasa aseaseeda meeduubi ng'asheega saseeda geaduupchi ng'asheega guroorooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fugiga aat geeshta ng'asheega saseedean iissa ghoapkaat iheenga nyaawa ng'asheega saseeda, amaduuku fugiga aat geeshta ng'asheega gurooroodean ghwayiin iheenga nyaawa ng'asheega Guroorooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gidagasa saseeda miyeeda gil, nea gidagasa guroorooda ea eaweega gil ea hoyyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fughareeda siikeal ng'asheega saseeda ea muy aba heeda ASEETA; ghanyea mamwasa deaweedeeda ASEETA, nea aba huumwa ghanyea maygwasissa mureeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea fugiga aat geeshta saseedean, ghanyea may ghoamu goohoosan ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea moowoosi fugiga aat geeshta ng'asheega saseedean, goowooschi fuga Guroorooda, aba huumwa iimida jeesingeagwa Guroorooda ASEETA. Siida mandeawana Guroorooda Gristo ghanyea maba niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Gristo ii mida jeesingeagwa earapeadi sasanuukeagwa nimeewa aba riing'eedean, gurooruunatkeagwa ea majeekcheewi aba doobiiwnata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea guroorooda siida ghayi aduuna Yesu jeeda miyeeda ii mida jeedeang'wa, abeeda siida ghayi aduuna Gristo Yesu jeeda miyeedean, gay ghoaghu sasanuukeagwa mida jea gameewa aba gurooroadaanyi mida jeesingeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi fuga eaduupcheewi, geendeawi siileeda, nea maba saseeda, ak geayaachi geeshta ng'asheega saseeda– ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea iyoopiideewi ng'asheega saseeda gajameewa, ama oopideewi Guroorooda abeeda ghoanung' gameewa gadiyoojiga saseeda ak abeeda gajanyasa eaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba buuneessean adoabiiw Guroorooda ASEETA, fiisu abeeda ea orjooga ASEETA gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghayi meegooneegwa guroorooda giing'oonyaneanduumeeda jea gweadu muuwda, ghayi geegooneegwa guroorooda jea ahuweewana orjooga. Nea geeyeawdi, “Bwaabwa! Bwaabwa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guroorooda niny gamuuwu sea gurooruunatkaasa gideaba aseasa geewooschi diibiga ASEETA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ama siwooschi diibiga, ada abeeda geewooschi fuga jea gwahearaniischi, fuga adaw ASEETA hearaniischooda, jea gwahearaniischi sea Gristo, asaha, iisisawaneasa sea niny abeeda iimuchu geakghaambiideasa sea niny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giigheambiita mida mwadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghaanung' ghoah sawanadeeni bea ghamneawean gili mii gili iyeahiimnyeadi sea giigheambiita numuji jea eetahaachneasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba haleanjeeda sean weelweel aba badayda ng'eanyiida gafurda nea gahoosan aba furdeayda giidaheachta orjooga ASEETA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea haleanjeeda ghayi sisin geanung' ghoah duguuga mwadaagha, nea mii gidagasiida niny gil gidagasiida deaghayi nung' earara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba haleanjeeda sean weelweel gay ghwanyas giibaldeaba geat ak geegeandeawa jeeda giing'oonyaneanduumeeda eadu nyariida, ak geanung' ghwanyas giibaldeaba geat bea giigheambiita diibiga ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geanali haleanjeeda sean weelweel iissa gamnyeani sean nea gwasawana ea ghoah ghamneawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea meakghusa haleanjeeda sisin, eara aseaseeda mideawa haghweega madeeda bea Guroorooda, ak eara aseasa geeniikghchi aba gurooruunatkaasa, nea geamuughu eahuuwa orjooga nea lealnooda sasanuukaasa gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aseasa geelealneasa aba gidida sirarjiin. Nea gidida sirarji nea geadaayiin ea mii gichea earar gil. Aba gideaba gajea ng'eaha jea ghwarar gidida daahiin? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama sirarji gidida meadaahaan, abeeda geefurdi nea gearjeang'di. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasunu eara Guroorooda ghaweadeasa aba ng'arng'arandeanya, aba gideaba mwoamu usi eamwaashta ASEETA gidahaguuwsiindaneasa, iidu iissa ghamwaash Guroorooda ghawooda aba badahuukaasa nea gaba geaw nea gwasawana aba giisiimeanda mwoamu eergu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida sikiideawa gurooruunatka buuneeda ghwanal fughareeda Guroorooda, aba gideaba Guroorooda gamusiischeesa fuga ghaydidi aba gidagasiida ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geanali gideaba aba jeeda ng'asheega sean iissa gwasin ASEETA gadiyeeda miy sea fugiga bwariiy ninyiin, fugiga ghayi siguursa aba gidagasiida ninyiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fugiga ghayi bay ghwanal niny amwadiin geegala sea orjeedaanyi, ak abeeda ghoah niny siichea eesheeda eeji aba jeeda fuga eaduupcheewi saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu fugiga ghayi bay ghwaloat amwadiin, iidu earaga siguursa, amadu fugiga guursean hean ghoadaw nea fugiga adaw doobiiwnatean ghoadaw giigheambiita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bariinyeega ASEETA mida jeeda Gristo Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gajeeyeenaan aba badaydeaba ng'asheesu? ASEETA iimida meatkweedeanya, abeeda gwanda ng'eaha uhuudeanya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyeeda ghayi mabwayda eara Orjeedaanyi asakaleala, ak gagu aba badahuukaasa eesa sean, niny maygagooneasa haleanjeeda miyaasiin sea niny? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gajea ng'eaha jea goorgweaksa fuga loat ASEETA? ASEETA gil dea adayiida doobiiwnata; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaygoorgweakseegwa ng'eaha? Gristo Yesu gil, ghayi meah, huumwa, ak gwaduuna miyeeda, ak gwanda geatinda dugwa bea ASEETA, amadu gimusiischooweasa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea ng'eaha gil siida jea gooheelaneasa sea bariinyeega Gristo? Heapi, gajea hang'weaniidoodea, ghana deawiitmeeda, ghana sawanadeeda, ghana jalooda, ghana dawiishnata, ghana haloota, ghana ng'uta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gidaghayi sing'waarda,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.36"
            ]
          }
        }
